{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Komatose</i> is a psychological horror point-and-click adventure that drags you into the dark corners of your own mind. After being violently attacked in a quiet town\u2014one where crime is almost unheard of\u2014you slip into a trauma-induced coma. But even in unconsciousness, you can't escape. Your mind becomes a twisted landscape, a distorted reflection of the hospital in which you are recovering, and you must navigate it to uncover the truth about what happened.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4046020?t=1758733193","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046020/82ed1cbc735629094831e03aca1819aae769bff0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758733193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046020/4e4809a2bc4c2c2698ac9aa0fa6906abff856f7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758733193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4046020/4e4809a2bc4c2c2698ac9aa0fa6906abff856f7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758733193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Depictions of blood, and violence. Sensitive topics such as domestic violence is alluded to."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Komatose</i> is a psychological horror point-and-click adventure that drags you into the dark corners of your own mind. After being violently attacked in a quiet town\u2014one where crime is almost unheard of\u2014you slip into a trauma-induced coma. But even in unconsciousness, you can't escape. Your mind becomes a twisted landscape, a distorted reflection of the hospital in which you are recovering, and you must navigate it to uncover the truth about what happened.</p>","developers":["Matt Cusworth"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.ak